<title>GREECE: FUND MANAGERS BRIEFED ON ATTICA ENTERP., ESHA.</title>
<headline>FUND MANAGERS BRIEFED ON ATTICA ENTERP., ESHA.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fund managers heard the latest financial news on shipper Attica Enterprises and asphalt producer Esha, the Union of Institutional Investors said.</p>
<p>Its programme of company presentations of Athens bourse listings continues in 1997.</p>
<p>--George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
